<title>GERMANY: German Dec producer prices unch from Nov.</title>
<headline>German Dec producer prices unch from Nov.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   Dec 96	Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  unch	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.3	  -0.3	   +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.8	 103.8	  104.1</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  -0.1	   UNCH</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.5	  -0.5	   +1.1</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.3	 103.3	  103.8</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  +0.1	   +0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.4	  +1.6	   +1.7</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  109.3	 109.3	  107.8</p>
<p>GERMAN AVERAGE PRODUCER PRICES	 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Annual figure			     -0.5	  +1.8</p>
<p> Annual index				103.5	 104.0</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
